  VALUES ('7b00dd18325934d11162e943c49e3391abf546ee72a2101ba1ece6ea20af3da8', 'sodai-signature', 'production', $seed${"contentVersion":1,"name":"Sodai","tagline":"A private retreat in Bali","heroTitle":"Somewhere to simply be.","intro":"Beyond the rush, beneath the palms. A small collection of private villas made for slow mornings, unhurried conversations, and the simple pleasure of feeling at home.","storyTitle":"Rooted in Bali. Made for you.","story":"Sodai began with a simple idea: make room for the things that matter. The sound of water. A meal shared slowly. A garden that changes with the light.\n\nOur fictional villa collection celebrates the island’s natural rhythm through open spaces, honest materials, and thoughtful hospitality. This is an illustrative website demo, rather than a real property listing.","storyPanels":[{"id":"beginning","enabled":true,"layout":"intro","title":"A slower beginning","body":["A place begins with a feeling. At Sodai, that feeling is the calm of arriving among palms, with the day still open before you."],"images":[{"src":"/images/nature.jpg","alt":"Sunlight over a Balinese landscape","category":"Nature"}],"caption":"An imagined retreat in Bali"},{"id":"island-fragments","enabled":true,"layout":"archive","title":"Collected moments","body":["Morning light, familiar materials, and a path that turns toward the garden."],"images":[{"src":"/images/beach.jpg","alt":"A quiet tropical shoreline under a blue sky","category":"Nature"},{"src":"/images/living.jpg","alt":"A warm, airy living room with natural materials","category":"Living"},{"src":"/images/pool.jpg","alt":"A tranquil blue swimming pool surrounded by palms","category":"Spaces"}],"caption":"Scenes from the fictional Sodai collection"},{"id":"thoughtful-spaces","enabled":true,"layout":"editorial","title":"Room to pause","body":["We imagined spaces with generous openings and quiet corners. Each villa invites the outdoors in, while leaving enough privacy to feel entirely at home.","The story is told in simple gestures: cool water after a warm day, a shaded seat, a table set for an unhurried meal."],"images":[{"src":"/images/room.jpg","alt":"A spacious bedroom with soft linen and natural light","category":"Living"}],"caption":"Soft light and natural textures"},{"id":"unhurried-rhythm","enabled":true,"layout":"quote","title":"Let the day unfold in its own time.","body":["There is no prescribed way to be here. Follow the light, rest awhile, and discover your own rhythm."],"images":[],"caption":""},{"id":"shared-table","enabled":true,"layout":"split","title":"Gather, then linger","body":["Breakfast can stretch into conversation. Later, the garden becomes a place to return to before the evening begins.","Our fictional hospitality is built around giving guests time and space, with thoughtful help close at hand."],"images":[{"src":"/images/dining.jpg","alt":"Thoughtfully prepared food served in a restaurant","category":"Living"},{"src":"/images/nature.jpg","alt":"Sunlight over a Balinese landscape","category":"Nature"}],"caption":"The pleasure of an open afternoon"},{"id":"island-culture","enabled":true,"layout":"culture","title":"A living island","body":["Bali's traditions belong to its communities. We invite visitors to approach them with curiosity, respect, and guidance from local hosts.","Its arts, ceremonies, and daily offerings make space for reflection beyond the villa walls."],"images":[{"src":"/images/beach.jpg","alt":"A quiet tropical shoreline under a blue sky","category":"Nature"}],"caption":"Explore Culture Bali"},{"id":"new-perspectives","enabled":true,"layout":"collage","title":"Always becoming","body":["The landscape changes with the hour. A familiar view feels new in rain, in morning haze, or just before dusk.","Sodai is a fictional villa demonstration, yet its invitation is real: notice the details and stay a little longer."],"images":[{"src":"/images/suite.jpg","alt":"A comfortable suite with a generous bed","category":"Living"},{"