t over a Balinese landscape","category":"Nature"},"heading":"Galungan","body":["The island's ceremonial calendar gives families time to gather. If a celebration coincides with your visit, ask a local guide how to observe respectfully."]},{"id":"kuningan-and-mekotek","enabled":true,"slug":"kuningan-and-mekotek","title":"Kuningan & Mekotek","summary":"Community traditions bring color and meaning to the day.","image":{"src":"/images/beach.jpg","alt":"A quiet tropical shoreline under a blue sky","category":"Nature"},"heading":"Kuningan & Mekotek","body":["These observances have their own local rhythms. Their meaning is best shared by the communities who hold them."]},{"id":"nyepi","enabled":true,"slug":"nyepi","title":"Nyepi","summary":"A day when the island becomes unusually still.","image":{"src":"/images/pool.jpg","alt":"A tranquil blue swimming pool surrounded by palms","category":"Spaces"},"heading":"Nyepi","body":["The Balinese New Year is marked by quiet. Visitors should plan ahead, respect local guidance, and make space for the slower pace."]},{"id":"melasti","enabled":true,"slug":"melasti","title":"Melasti","summary":"A ceremonial journey toward the water.","image":{"src":"/images/beach.jpg","alt":"A quiet tropical shoreline under a blue sky","category":"Nature"},"heading":"Melasti","body":["On days of purification, processions may move toward the sea. Watch only where welcomed and give worshippers room."]},{"id":"ogoh-ogoh","enabled":true,"slug":"ogoh-ogoh","title":"Ogoh-ogoh","summary":"Community-made figures fill the streets before Nyepi.","image":{"src":"/images/living.jpg","alt":"A warm, airy living room with natural materials","category":"Living"},"heading":"Ogoh-ogoh","body":["Creative work can be seen in neighborhood processions. Local routes and viewing customs vary."]},{"id":"piodalan","enabled":true,"slug":"piodalan","title":"Piodalan","summary":"A temple anniversary shaped by shared devotion.","image":{"src":"/images/nature.jpg","alt":"Sunlight over