 for an unhurried meal."],"images":[{"src":"/images/room.jpg","alt":"A spacious bedroom with soft linen and natural light","category":"Living"}],"caption":"Soft light and natural textures"},{"id":"unhurried-rhythm","enabled":true,"layout":"quote","title":"Let the day unfold in its own time.","body":["There is no prescribed way to be here. Follow the light, rest awhile, and discover your own rhythm."],"images":[],"caption":""},{"id":"shared-table","enabled":true,"layout":"split","title":"Gather, then linger","body":["Breakfast can stretch into conversation. Later, the garden becomes a place to return to before the evening begins.","Our fictional hospitality is built around giving guests time and space, with thoughtful help close at hand."],"images":[{"src":"/images/dining.jpg","alt":"Thoughtfully prepared food served in a restaurant","category":"Living"},{"src":"/images/nature.jpg","alt":"Sunlight over a Balinese landscape","category":"Nature"}],"caption":"The pleasure of an open afternoon"},{"id":"island-culture","enabled":true,"layout":"culture","title":"A living island","body":["Bali's traditions belong to its communities. We invite visitors to approach them with curiosity, respect, and guidance from local hosts.","Its arts, ceremonies, and daily offerings make space for reflection beyond the villa walls."],"images":[{"src":"/images/beach.jpg","alt":"A quiet tropical shoreline under a blue sky","category":"Nature"}],"caption":"Explore Culture Bali"},{"id":"new-perspectives","enabled":true,"layout":"collage","title":"Always becoming","body":["The landscape changes with the hour. A familiar view feels new in rain, in morning haze, or just before dusk.","Sodai is a fictional villa demonstration, yet its invitation is real: notice the details and stay a little longer."],"images":[{"src":"/images/suite.jpg","alt":"A comfortable suite with a generous bed","category":"Living"},{"src":"/images/pool.jpg","alt":"A tranquil blue swimming pool surrounded by palms","category":"Spaces"},{"src":"/images/living.jpg","alt":"A warm, airy living room with natural materials","category":"Living"}],"caption":"Different corners, one gentle pace"},{"id":"stay-with-us","enabled":true,"layout":"closing","title":"Come as you are. Leave with time to remember.","body":["Whether you seek solitude or time together, this imagined place is here to show how a stay can feel personal.","Turn the page and find your own space."],"images":[{"src":"/images/hero.jpg","alt":"A palm-lined tropical resort with a turquoise swimming pool","category":"Spaces"}],"caption":"Sodai · an illustrative villa collection"},{"id":"a-moment-between","enabled":true,"layout":"cinematic","title":"A moment between places","body":["Where the shore meets the light, let the story linger a little longer."],"images":[{"src":"/images/beach.jpg","alt":"A quiet tropical shoreline under a blue sky","category":"Nature"}],"caption":"An image-led pause in the fictional villa story"}],"culture":{"enabled":true,"hero":{"src":"/images/nature.jpg","alt":"Sunlight over a Balinese landscape","category":"Nature"},"title":"Culture Bali","introTitle":"Across the island, culture lives in everyday moments.","intro":["Some traditions unfold close by; others ask for a longer journey. Each is part of a living community rather than an attraction arranged for visitors.","The calendar changes from year to year. Ask a local host about current observances, and travel with care for the people and places you meet."],"introImages":[{"src":"/images/beach.jpg","alt":"A quiet tropical shoreline under a blue sky","category":"Nature"},{"src":"/images/dining.jpg","alt":"Thoughtfully prepared food served in a restaurant","category":"Living"}],"entries":[{"id":"galungan","enabled":true,"slug":"galungan","title":"Galungan","summary":"A season of family, ceremony, and decorated streets.","image":{"src":"/images/nature.jpg","alt":"Sunlight over a Balinese landscape","category":"Nature"},"heading":"Galungan","body":["The island's ceremonial calendar gives families time to gather. If a celebration coincides with your visit, ask a local guide how to observe respectfully."]},{"id":"kuningan-and-mekotek","enabled":true,"slug":"kuningan-and-mekotek","title":"Kuningan & Mekotek","summary":"Community traditions bring color and meaning to the day.","image":{"src":"/images/beach.jpg","alt":"A quiet tropical shoreline under a blue sky","category":"Nature"},"heading":"Kuningan & Mekotek","body":["These observances have their own local rhythms. Their meaning is best shared by the communities who hold them."]},{"id":"nyepi","enabled":true,"slug":"nyepi","title":"Nyepi","summary":"A day when the island becomes unusually still.","image":{"src":"/images/pool.jpg","alt":"A tranquil blue swimming pool surrounded by palms","category":"Spaces"},"heading":"Nyepi","body":["The Balinese New Year is marked by quiet. Visitors should plan ahead, respect local guidance, and make space for the slower pace."]},{"id":"melasti","enabled":true,"slug":"melasti","title":"Melasti","summary":"A ceremonial journey toward the water.","image":{"src":"/images/beach.jpg","alt":"A quiet tropical shoreline under a blue sky","category":"Nature"},"heading":"Melasti","body":["On days of purification, processions may move toward the sea. Watch only where welcomed and give worshippers room."]},{"id":"ogoh-ogoh","enabled":true,"slug":"ogoh-ogoh","title":"Ogoh-ogoh","summary":"Community-made figures fill the streets before Nyepi.","image":{"src":"/images/living.jpg","alt":"A warm, airy living room with natural materials","category":"Living"},"heading":"Ogoh-ogoh","body":["Creative work can be seen in neighborhood processions. Local routes and viewing customs vary."]},{"id":"piodalan","enabled":true,"slug":"piodalan","title":"Piodalan","summary":"A temple anniversary shaped by shared devotion.","image":{"src":"/images/nature.jpg","alt":"Sunlight over a Balinese landscape","category":"Nature"},"heading":"Piodalan","body":["Ceremonies belong first to the worshipping community. Dress and behave according to local guidance if invited to visit."]},{"id":"bali-art-festival","enabled":true,"slug":"bali-art-festival","title":"Bali Arts Festival","summary":"Performances and craft celebrate the island's artists.","image":{"src":"/images/dining.jpg","alt":"Thoughtfully prepared food served in a restaurant","category":"Living"},"heading":"Bali Arts Festival","body":["Ask your host about current public programs and support the people who make the work."]},{"id":"perang-pandan-and-ayunan-jantra","enabled":true,"slug":"perang-pandan-and-ayunan-jantra","title":"Perang Pandan & Ayunan Jantra","summary":"Distinct traditions of an island community.","image":{"src":"/images/suite.jpg","alt":"A comfortable suite with a generous bed","category":"Living"},"heading":"Perang Pandan & Ayunan Jantra","body":["Ceremonies are rooted in place. Travel with a knowledgeable local guide and honor any limits on attendance or photography."]},{"id":"purnama-and-tilem","enabled":true,"slug":"purnama-and-tilem","title":"Purnama & Tilem","summary":"Moon phases mark recurring moments of reflection.","image":{"src":"/images/hero.jpg","alt":"A palm-lined tropical resort with a turquoise swimming pool","category":"Spaces"},"heading":"Purnama & Tilem","body":["You may notice offerings and gatherings through the month. A local host can explain what is appropriate to observe."]},{"id":"offerings","enabled":true,"slug":"offerings","title":"Offerings","summary":"Small daily gestures are visible across Bali.","image":{"src":"/images/room.jpg","alt":"A spacious bedroom with soft linen and natural light","category":"Living"},"heading":"Offerings","body":["Offerings are part of everyday practice. Leave them undisturbed and ask before photographing people at prayer."]}]},"address":"Ubud, Bali, Indonesia · illustrative location","email":"stay@example.com","mapUrl":"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&query=Ubud+Bali","hero":{"src":"/images/hero.jpg","alt":"A palm-lined tropical resort with a turquoise swimming pool","category":"Spaces"},"gallery":[{"src":"/images/hero.jpg","alt":"A palm-lined tropical resort with a turquoise swimming pool","category":"Spaces"},{"src":"/images/room.jpg","alt":"A spacious bedroom with soft linen and natural light","category":"Living"},{"src":"/images/pool.jpg","alt":"A tranquil blue swimming pool surrounded by palms","category":"Spaces"},{"src":"/images/living.jpg","alt":"A warm, airy living room with natural materials","category":"Living"},{"src":"/images/dining.jpg","alt":"Thoughtfully prepared food served in a restaurant","category":"Living"},{"src":"/images/nature.jpg","alt":"Sunlight over a Balinese landscape","category":"Nature"},{"src":"/images/beach.jpg","alt":"A quiet tropical shoreline under a blue sky","category":"Nature"},{"src":"/images/suite.jpg","alt":"A comfortable suite with a generous bed","category":"Living"}],"amenities":["Private pool","Daily breakfast","Garden living","Thoughtful service","Fast Wi-Fi","Airport transfer"],"rooms":[{"id":"rooms-garden-villa","slug":"garden-villa","title":"Garden Villa","description":"Your own quiet corner of the island. Wake to birdsong, linger beside the pool, and let the day unfold at its own pace.","image":{"src":"/images/pool.jpg","alt":"A tranquil blue swimming pool surrounded by palms","category":"Spaces"},"capacity":2,"area":120,"facilities":["Private swimming pool","King-size bed","Outdoor terrace","Air conditioning","Wi-Fi","Rain shower"],"inclusions":["Daily breakfast for two","Daily housekeeping","Welcome refreshments"]},{"id":"rooms-pool-suite","slug":"pool-suite","title":"Pool Suite","description":"Soft linens, sunlit spaces, and water just a few steps away. An intimate sanctuary designed for two.","image":{"src":"/images/room.jpg","alt":"A spacious bedroom with soft linen and natural light","category":"Living"},"capacity":2,"area":85,"facilities":["Pool access","King-size bed","Private terrace","Air conditioning","Wi-Fi"],"inclusions":["Daily breakfast for two","Daily housekeeping"]},{"id":"rooms-family-residence","slug":"family-residence","title":"Family Residence","description":"A little more space to come together. Two bedrooms, a generous living room, and a private garden for memories in the making.","image":{"src":"/images/living.jpg","alt":"A warm, airy living room with natural materials","category":"Living"},"capacity":4,"area":210,"facilities":["Two bedrooms","Private pool","Kitchenette","Garden","Air conditioning","Wi-Fi"],"inclusions":["Daily breakfast for four","Daily housekeeping","Welcome refreshments"]}],"modules":{"dining":true,"experiences":true,"packages":true,"terms":true},"dining":{"title":"At the table, together.","description":"Seasonal ingredients. Familiar flavours. A generous spirit. Enjoy a leisurely breakfast or gather for an intimate dinner inspired by the island.","image":{"src":"/images/dining.jpg","alt":"Thoughtfully prepared food served in a restaurant","category":"Living"},"bookingUrl":""},"experiences":[{"id":"experiences-island-mornings","slug":"island-mornings","title":"Island mornings","description":"Follow the paths through green rice fields and discover a quieter side of Bali. Ask your host about a personal itinerary.","image":{"src":"/images/nature.jpg","alt":"Sunlight over a Balinese landscape","category":"Nature"}},{"id":"experiences-by-the-sea","slug":"by-the-sea","title":"A day by the sea","description":"Salt in the air, sand beneath your feet. Take the scenic route to the coast and leave the afternoon open.","image":{"src":"/images/beach.jpg","alt":"A quiet tropical shoreline under a blue sky","category":"Nature"}}],"packages":[{"id":"packages-slow-stay","slug":"slow-stay","title":"Stay a little longer","description":"Make time for a slower escape. Contact your host to discuss a tailored stay, breakfast, and transfers. Demo offer; no live pricing.","image":{"src":"/images/pool.jpg","alt":"A tranquil blue swimming pool surrounded by palms","category":"Spaces"}}],"terms":"This is a fictional villa website demonstration. Images are illustrative and do not represent an actual property. Reservations, rates, cancellation policies, and availability must be confirmed directly with your host. No payments are collected on this website.","booking":{"controlsEnabled":false,"mode":"external","whatsapp":"","url":"https://example.com","message":"Hello {villa}, I would like to enquire about {room}."},"showAdminLink":true,"showCmsLinkInNavigation":true}$seed$::jsonb, 'operator', 'seed' FROM site
